          "viz": "<svg viewBox='0 0 660 160' role='img' aria-label='多源报告归一化：口径对齐才可比' style='width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:12px 0;border:1px solid #DDD8CB;border-radius:10px;background:#fff' font-family=\"system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x='0' y='0' width='660' height='160' fill='#FBFaf6'/><text x='12' y='20' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b'>厂家报告字段与量纲各不相同：先归一化，后面的比对才有意义</text><rect x='20' y='36' width='190' height='66' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='34' y='56' font-size='10' fill='#3d4a48'>A 厂报告</text><text x='34' y='74' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>精度：%FS · 温漂：ppm/℃</text><text x='34' y='92' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>标定：二点</text><rect x='230' y='36' width='190' height='66' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='244' y='56' font-size='10' fill='#3d4a48'>B 厂报告</text><text x='244' y='74' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>精度：MPa · 温漂：kPa/℃</text><text x='244' y='92' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>标定：五点</text><line x1='180' y1='120' x2='300' y2='120' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.4'/><polygon points='300,120 294,116.5 294,123.5' fill='#2f7d6b'/><rect x='440' y='36' width='208' height='66' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='454' y='56' font-size='10' fill='#3d4a48'>统一字段</text><text x='454' y='74' font-size='8.5' fill='#2f7d6b'>精度统一到 %FS</text><text x='454' y='92' font-size='8.5' fill='#2f7d6b'>温漂统一到 ppm/℃</text><text x='454' y='110' font-size='8.5' fill='#2f7d6b'>标定点数作为置信度权重</text><text x='20' y='138' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>归一化不是格式转换：量纲与口径对齐后，数值才真正可比</text><text x='12' y='152' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>这一步做不干净，后面的基线比对就是在比不同单位</text></svg><div class='viz-cap'>图：多源报告归一化：口径对齐才可比</div>"
        },
        {
          "name": "同型号基线建立",
          "role": "算法",
          "do": "按型号汇总正常仪器的自检与测试特征，建立该型号的正常基线与允许区间。",
