          "viz": "<svg viewBox='0 0 660 148' role='img' aria-label='四类故障的判据：间歇故障必须多次重试统计' style='width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:12px 0;border:1px solid #DDD8CB;border-radius:10px;background:#fff' font-family=\"system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x='0' y='0' width='660' height='148' fill='#FBFaf6'/><text x='12' y='20' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b'>四类故障各有判据：漂移看趋势，通讯看重试，电路看特征，机械看动作</text><rect x='20' y='34' width='150' height='48' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='32' y='54' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>① 传感器漂移</text><text x='32' y='70' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>阶跃后趋势项偏离</text><text x='32' y='86' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>≥ 2 h 测试才可见</text><rect x='180' y='34' width='150' height='48' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='192' y='54' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>② 通讯中断</text><text x='192' y='70' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>重试次数与误码率</text><text x='192' y='86' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>单次通过不算通过</text><rect x='340' y='34' width='150' height='48' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='352' y='54' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>③ 电路异常</text><text x='352' y='70' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>工作电流与温升</text><text x='352' y='86' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>与基线比曲线形状</text><rect x='500' y='34' width='148' height='48' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='512' y='54' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>④ 机械卡滞</text><text x='512' y='70' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>动作时间与行程</text><text x='512' y='86' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>行程不足即卡滞</text><text x='20' y='104' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b'>判据偏严误判好仪器（增加成本），偏宽漏判（代价更大）：按后果加权</text><rect x='20' y='112' width='628' height='18' rx='4' fill='#f6e8da' stroke='#e8cdae'/><text x='32' y='125' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>间歇性故障最易放过：测的时候正好通，必须做多次重试统计</text><text x='12' y='140' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>四类判据都来自历史故障样本：没有样本时只能做偏离检测，不能做分类</text></svg><div class='viz-cap'>图：四类故障的判据：间歇故障必须多次重试统计</div>"
        },
        {
          "name": "处置建议与复核",
          "role": "算法",
